WEBVTT

00:08.080 --> 00:09.430
<b>Tomozaki?</b>

00:13.720 --> 00:15.870
<b>You wanted advice?</b>

00:16.140 --> 00:19.420
<b>You're always messing with Tama,</b>

00:19.420 --> 00:22.010
<b>so I figured you might be 
able to give me some tips.</b>

00:22.010 --> 00:25.490
<b>Now hang on, Tomozaki! 
That's simply inexcusable!</b>

00:25.880 --> 00:28.130
<b>I'm not <i>messing with</i> Tama—</b>

00:28.860 --> 00:31.790
<b>I'm simply expressing my love!</b>

00:32.880 --> 00:34.650
<b>Uh, sure...</b>

00:34.650 --> 00:36.310
<b>What a weak response!</b>

00:36.310 --> 00:38.880
<b>C'mon, work with me here!</b>

00:38.880 --> 00:40.710
<b>Oh, um...</b>

00:40.710 --> 00:44.980
<b>Y-You sure have a funny way of 
expressing your love, Mimimi!</b>

00:45.800 --> 00:48.780
<b>Pulling out Tama's signature move?
 Leave it to you, Brain!</b>

00:48.780 --> 00:50.120
<b>Y-Yeah?</b>

00:50.120 --> 00:51.150
<b>Totally!</b>

00:51.680 --> 00:54.320
<b>You're the only comedy partner for me, Brain!</b>

00:54.320 --> 00:57.260
<b>Now you're roping me into doing stand-up?</b>

00:59.080 --> 01:02.930
<b>Anyway, what is it about Tama that 
you target for your teasing—</b>

01:03.630 --> 01:07.120
<b>er, your expressions of love?</b>

01:08.790 --> 01:12.130
<b>Hmm... Her cuteness and her tininess?</b>

01:12.700 --> 01:14.490
<b>I figured...</b>

01:15.060 --> 01:19.890
<b>Okay, have you seen any good 
comedy routines lately?</b>

01:19.890 --> 01:22.100
<b>Huh? Where'd <i>that</i> come from?</b>

01:22.350 --> 01:23.450
<b>I was just thinking...</b>

01:23.450 --> 01:27.570
<b>if Tama had an obvious 
vulnerability like Takei,</b>

01:27.570 --> 01:31.440
<b>the class could get used to 
it as part of her character.</b>

01:31.960 --> 01:33.280
<b>It's for research.</b>

01:36.200 --> 01:37.590
<b>Aha.</b>

01:38.280 --> 01:42.170
<b>I mean, I have a bunch of ideas, but...</b>

01:42.670 --> 01:43.990
<b>Oh, Tomozaki.</b>

01:44.300 --> 01:45.500
<b>You're a sneaky one.</b>

01:46.840 --> 01:52.230
<b>So quick to get embarrassed, but when push 
comes to shove... boy, can you shove.</b>

01:52.230 --> 01:52.590
<b>Hah!</b>

01:53.750 --> 01:54.460
<b>What the—</b>

01:54.730 --> 01:57.440
<b>Your hero complex has earned 
you a piggy-nose punishment.</b>

01:57.440 --> 01:59.460
<b>I don't know what any of that means!</b>

02:00.360 --> 02:02.190
<b>You don't have to!</b>

02:03.290 --> 02:05.980
<b>Oh, man! You're so <i>ugly</i>!</b>

02:06.960 --> 02:11.550
<b>Y-You can be ugly on the outside 
with a beautiful heart... probably!</b>

02:11.550 --> 02:13.790
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

02:19.220 --> 02:21.920
<b>Comedy routines, was it?</b>

02:21.920 --> 02:23.270
<b>Let's see...</b>

02:24.220 --> 02:27.470
<b><i>Wait... what the hell was all</i> that <i>about?!</i></b>

03:58.340 --> 04:01.630
<b>2nd Stage: Lv. 4
Villagers have their own way of life</b>

04:02.240 --> 04:04.010
<b>Oops. Sorry.</b>

04:04.530 --> 04:09.010
<b><i>The Konno girls' harassment 
of Tama continued.</i></b>

04:09.390 --> 04:11.550
<b><i>But Tama kept on putting up with it,</i></b>

04:11.550 --> 04:17.280
<b><i>which made the class seem to 
grow more and more sympathetic.</i></b>

04:18.710 --> 04:23.260
<b><i>Hinami, too, kept on creating a 
protective atmosphere for Tama.</i></b>

04:24.070 --> 04:24.860
<b><i>And what's more...</i></b>

04:25.640 --> 04:26.780
<b>Hinami did what?</b>

04:27.190 --> 04:32.550
<b>She asked me not to hang 
out with Shuji for the time being.</b>

04:33.070 --> 04:36.920
<b>Not even outside of school. 
Erika might see us, she said.</b>

04:36.920 --> 04:41.800
<b>I guess it <i>would</i> get pretty 
messy if Erika saw you.</b>

04:42.060 --> 04:45.860
<b>Right? When I told Shuji, he got all huffy,</b>

04:45.860 --> 04:49.120
<b>like, "Fine by me."</b>

04:49.600 --> 04:51.310
<b>And that's why</b>

04:51.870 --> 04:56.310
<b>I've been thinking I'd knit 
or sew him something</b>

04:56.310 --> 04:57.820
<b>to get on his good side.</b>

04:59.400 --> 05:02.450
<b><i>Would that even work on Nakamura?</i></b>

05:03.250 --> 05:05.220
<b>Maybe I'm just being selfish.</b>

05:05.800 --> 05:10.320
<b>I always dreamed of giving a 
boyfriend hand-knitted presents,</b>

05:10.320 --> 05:11.620
<b>but...</b>

05:11.900 --> 05:15.870
<b>Could you stop being all shy about it?
 <i>You're</i> the one who brought it up.</b>

05:19.110 --> 05:20.380
<b>Oh, sh-shut up!</b>

05:22.760 --> 05:28.690
<b><i>Still, it doesn't strike me as very 
Hinami-like to make such a big ask of Izumi.</i></b>

05:29.300 --> 05:33.600
<b><i>She must be at her wits' end, too.</i></b>

05:33.600 --> 05:35.600
<b>Old AV Room</b>

05:36.110 --> 05:38.100
<b><i>Then came lunchtime.</i></b>

05:39.890 --> 05:42.320
<b>Hey! Sorry I'm late.</b>

05:42.320 --> 05:45.100
<b>Took me a while to blow off Shuji.</b>

05:45.100 --> 05:46.700
<b>Sorry for all this.</b>

05:46.700 --> 05:49.830
<b>Don't sweat it. How's the practice going?</b>

05:49.830 --> 05:52.840
<b>Well... how <i>is</i> it going, professor?</b>

05:53.450 --> 05:55.450
<b>"Professor"? You can't mean me?</b>

05:55.740 --> 05:59.710
<b>That's right. You coach me at every break.</b>

06:00.380 --> 06:01.980
<b>I-I guess so.</b>

06:02.660 --> 06:06.720
<b>Um... I think practice 
is coming along nicely.</b>

06:07.060 --> 06:07.860
<b>Really?!</b>

06:07.860 --> 06:11.080
<b>Good. Then let's see you in Takei Mode.</b>

06:11.080 --> 06:12.220
<b>Got it.</b>

06:14.800 --> 06:16.100
<b>Bring it on!</b>

06:16.410 --> 06:18.080
<b>Ooh, nice.</b>

06:18.080 --> 06:20.230
<b>Right? I spent a lot of time practicing!</b>

06:20.480 --> 06:22.480
<b>Yeah? What did that involve?</b>

06:22.480 --> 06:27.760
<b>I recorded myself talking, compared 
it to how Takei and Minmi talk,</b>

06:27.760 --> 06:29.110
<b>and corrected my own speech!</b>

06:29.360 --> 06:33.120
<b>So you modeled after Takei 
and Mimimi? Good choice.</b>

06:33.120 --> 06:37.270
<b>And Tomozaki didn't come up with that—<i>I</i> did!</b>

06:37.270 --> 06:38.230
<b>Awesome, right?</b>

06:39.130 --> 06:40.910
<b>Totally awesome, yep.</b>

06:40.910 --> 06:43.130
<b>Hey! Say it like you mean it!</b>

06:43.130 --> 06:45.100
<b>Oh, right. Sorry.</b>

06:45.100 --> 06:47.020
<b>That too!</b>

06:50.160 --> 06:51.940
<b>So what do you think?</b>

06:52.640 --> 06:55.890
<b>I've been trying to speak 
more cheerfully than before.</b>

06:56.130 --> 06:58.820
<b>Oh, yeah—you're a lot easier to talk to now,</b>

06:58.820 --> 07:00.620
<b>and I think your charm is coming through.</b>

07:00.620 --> 07:01.650
<b>Really?!</b>

07:01.870 --> 07:05.400
<b>Okay, Tama, try that other thing next.</b>

07:05.630 --> 07:08.070
<b>Oh, there's more?</b>

07:08.070 --> 07:12.620
<b>I used these comedy routines 
Minmi told me about as reference.</b>

07:12.620 --> 07:14.450
<b>If you would, Tomozaki?</b>

07:14.450 --> 07:15.370
<b>Here goes!</b>

07:16.890 --> 07:20.000
<b>Huh? Why are you so far away, Tama?</b>

07:20.000 --> 07:25.380
<b>I only <i>look</i> like I'm far away—
I'm just short! It's called perspective!</b>

07:25.380 --> 07:26.500
<b>Oh, really?</b>

07:26.500 --> 07:28.240
<b>Yes, really! It's an optical illusion!</b>

07:28.240 --> 07:31.790
<b>But listen, this room is 
bigger than I thought, too.</b>

07:31.790 --> 07:33.760
<b>I told you, it's because I'm <i>short</i>!</b>

07:33.760 --> 07:36.510
<b>It only looks bigger in comparison!</b>

07:42.800 --> 07:43.770
<b>What the heck?</b>

07:44.190 --> 07:45.880
<b>We thought this was an easy way</b>

07:45.880 --> 07:50.010
<b>to get the class used to Tama's 
specific vulnerability.</b>

07:50.010 --> 07:54.410
<b>Not bad at all. You had 
me wanting to join in.</b>

07:56.010 --> 07:57.410
<b>That's our Fumiya.</b>

07:57.810 --> 08:01.010
<b>The teacher and his brilliant student.</b>

08:01.010 --> 08:02.450
<b>Well, y-you know.</b>

08:02.450 --> 08:04.830
<b>A<i>hem</i>! "Brilliant" is right!</b>

08:05.100 --> 08:07.140
<b>Y'know what's sad, though...</b>

08:07.140 --> 08:11.010
<b>seeing the teacher left completely 
in the dust by his student.</b>

08:11.010 --> 08:12.540
<b>I g-guess...</b>

08:12.960 --> 08:14.220
<b>Tomozaki?</b>

08:14.790 --> 08:16.180
<b>Too bad for you!</b>

08:18.110 --> 08:21.350
<b>I'd say Tama can start mixing 
with the rest of the class now,</b>

08:21.730 --> 08:24.480
<b>but maybe be a little careful at first.</b>

08:24.480 --> 08:30.320
<b>Uh... so a little more practice in 
a setting where it's okay to fail.</b>

08:30.320 --> 08:30.980
<b>Bingo.</b>

08:31.260 --> 08:35.260
<b>I'd like to bring someone in 
for a dress rehearsal of sorts,</b>

08:35.260 --> 08:38.620
<b>but everyone's avoiding Tama right now.</b>

08:38.880 --> 08:41.620
<b>Oh, right... This is gonna be tough.</b>

08:41.870 --> 08:44.810
<b>Aoi and Mimimi are on our side, 
but they're too friendly with Tama.</b>

08:44.810 --> 08:46.770
<b>It'd hardly be practice.</b>

08:46.770 --> 08:47.630
<b>So that leaves...</b>

08:47.880 --> 08:49.080
<b>Izumi?</b>

08:50.230 --> 08:53.630
<b>If Erika happened to find out, 
Yuzu's standing would suffer.</b>

08:53.890 --> 08:55.520
<b>Right...</b>

08:56.000 --> 08:56.640
<b>Oh!</b>

08:57.250 --> 08:59.110
<b>Did you think of somebody?</b>

08:59.110 --> 09:00.890
<b>Ooh, ooh! Who is it?</b>

09:01.170 --> 09:04.780
<b>Let me check with them first.</b>

09:07.650 --> 09:09.570
<b>Library</b>

09:10.550 --> 09:12.070
<b>I'm nervous...</b>

09:12.330 --> 09:14.310
<b>I-I get that.</b>

09:14.310 --> 09:18.000
<b>I just talk to Hanabi normally, right?</b>

09:18.000 --> 09:22.080
<b>Right. You haven't spoken 
with her much, have you?</b>

09:22.350 --> 09:27.350
<b>No. I've thought of her 
as one <i>very</i> strong girl...</b>

09:27.350 --> 09:29.330
<b>But no, I've never actually talked to her.</b>

09:31.780 --> 09:38.390
<b>What do you think about Konno harassing 
Tama and everyone avoiding her?</b>

09:39.050 --> 09:40.100
<b>Well...</b>

09:40.540 --> 09:45.410
<b>I feel sorry for Hanabi. I think it's unfair.</b>

09:45.410 --> 09:51.030
<b>But I can't bring myself to blame 
Konno or the rest of the class.</b>

09:51.760 --> 09:52.860
<b>What do you mean?</b>

09:53.080 --> 09:56.270
<b>Um... well, I don't agree with harassment</b>

09:56.270 --> 10:01.620
<b>or with going along with the 
crowd to shun any one person.</b>

10:02.160 --> 10:09.130
<b>But I think Konno and the class must 
be doing all this because they're weak.</b>

10:09.600 --> 10:10.880
<b>Weak?</b>

10:12.940 --> 10:18.600
<b>There must be a kind of uneasiness inside 
them that they can't resolve on their own.</b>

10:18.600 --> 10:21.600
<b>If they don't vent it somehow, 
it gets to be too much to bear.</b>

10:21.600 --> 10:24.260
<b>And they worry about how they look 
to others, so they join the crowd.</b>

10:25.120 --> 10:27.340
<b>It might be something like that.</b>

10:28.080 --> 10:33.300
<b>I think Konno and the others 
are acting like this</b>

10:33.300 --> 10:35.870
<b>in order to run away from 
something they can't fix.</b>

10:35.870 --> 10:37.280
<b>Even though it's wrong.</b>

10:37.830 --> 10:39.590
<b>Running away, huh...</b>

10:40.480 --> 10:41.530
<b>Yes.</b>

10:42.000 --> 10:46.030
<b>Which is why I get the feeling, out of
 Konno and the class and Hanabi,</b>

10:46.030 --> 10:50.260
<b>that Hanabi must be the 
strongest of them all.</b>

10:50.260 --> 10:51.540
<b>You may be right.</b>

10:51.990 --> 10:58.690
<b>And I wonder if Konno and the others 
aren't relying on that strength.</b>

10:58.690 --> 11:02.550
<b>Because you can lean on it and lean 
on it—and Hanabi still won't fall.</b>

11:03.930 --> 11:04.810
<b>Still...</b>

11:04.810 --> 11:08.150
<b>his problem needs to be solved somehow.</b>

11:08.870 --> 11:14.560
<b>Which is why I'm glad I can be 
a part of it, thanks to you.</b>

11:14.890 --> 11:17.520
<b>Right. Let's solve this together.</b>

11:17.520 --> 11:19.450
<b>We'll do our very best.</b>

11:26.650 --> 11:30.580
<b>It's from Tama. Volleyball 
practice is over, she says.</b>

11:43.930 --> 11:45.930
<b>Old AV Room</b>

11:49.590 --> 11:51.300
<b>Nervous?</b>

11:51.300 --> 11:52.180
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

11:52.180 --> 11:54.380
<b>What, don't you trust Fumiya?</b>

11:54.380 --> 11:55.270
<b>Nuh-uh.</b>

11:56.400 --> 11:57.940
<b>This is all me.</b>

12:07.640 --> 12:08.890
<b>Kikuchi?</b>

12:10.040 --> 12:12.040
<b>Bottom-Tier Character Tomozaki S2</b>

12:15.190 --> 12:16.920
<b>Hello, Fuka.</b>

12:17.170 --> 12:19.520
<b>Y-Yes, hello.</b>

12:19.520 --> 12:22.810
<b>Is Kikuchi who you had in mind?</b>

12:22.810 --> 12:24.550
<b>Yeah, that's right.</b>

12:25.280 --> 12:26.510
<b>Hmm...</b>

12:29.350 --> 12:32.810
<b>Well, she <i>is</i> a neutral party 
with no ties to Konno,</b>

12:32.810 --> 12:35.210
<b>and not especially friendly with Tama...</b>

12:35.210 --> 12:36.530
<b>I'd say she's ideal.</b>

12:36.530 --> 12:37.810
<b>R-Right?</b>

12:38.110 --> 12:40.590
<b>Did Fumiya talk to you, Kikuchi?</b>

12:40.590 --> 12:43.090
<b>About our strategy for helping Tama?</b>

12:43.090 --> 12:45.200
<b>Yes, he has told me about that.</b>

12:45.510 --> 12:48.700
<b>Okay. Er, why such formal speech?</b>

12:49.690 --> 12:51.660
<b>Um... we're not close yet.</b>

12:53.200 --> 12:55.420
<b>Well, whatever. Now, shall we?</b>

12:56.330 --> 12:57.900
<b>A-All right.</b>

13:03.970 --> 13:06.450
<b>There's more to you than 
meets the eye, Fumiya.</b>

13:06.450 --> 13:07.930
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

13:08.570 --> 13:10.260
<b>Nah, it's just...</b>

13:10.850 --> 13:14.270
<b><i>She may not stand out much, but 
that Kikuchi is awful cute.</i></b>

13:15.710 --> 13:16.420
<b>What?</b>

13:16.850 --> 13:18.160
<b>Nothing.</b>

13:18.160 --> 13:19.260
<b>Hmm...</b>

13:20.100 --> 13:21.680
<b>Thank you in advance.</b>

13:21.680 --> 13:23.190
<b>Same here.</b>

13:23.530 --> 13:25.770
<b>It's like some kind of competition.</b>

13:25.770 --> 13:30.580
<b>Yeah. I mean, it kind of 
<i>is</i> a real contest for Tama.</b>

13:30.580 --> 13:34.200
<b>Um... where should we begin?</b>

13:36.330 --> 13:39.210
<b>I didn't know you were friends with Tomozaki.</b>

13:41.660 --> 13:45.130
<b>Yes, I've had the recent 
pleasure of his friendship.</b>

13:45.130 --> 13:48.140
<b>Don't you think he's cheered up lately?</b>

13:48.140 --> 13:52.160
<b>I do. And I find it so wonderful when 
people work to change themselves</b>

13:52.160 --> 13:54.140
<b>to be who they want to be.</b>

13:54.770 --> 13:55.850
<b>Wonderful...</b>

13:56.410 --> 13:57.520
<b>You heard her.</b>

13:57.520 --> 13:58.350
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

13:59.110 --> 14:01.750
<b>It's wonderful to change yourself?</b>

14:01.750 --> 14:03.360
<b>Do you really think so?</b>

14:03.850 --> 14:06.240
<b>Yes, and if that's what a person wants to do,</b>

14:06.700 --> 14:08.990
<b>I think that's just spectacular.</b>

14:10.330 --> 14:10.990
<b>I mean,</b>

14:11.490 --> 14:13.180
<b><i>this is for Mimimi, after all.</i></b>

14:14.710 --> 14:15.440
<b>Uh-huh!</b>

14:17.440 --> 14:20.750
<b>It's been rough lately, huh, Hanabi?</b>

14:21.130 --> 14:24.750
<b>Sometimes I'm like, "Ugh," 
but I'm okay—honest.</b>

14:24.750 --> 14:27.260
<b>I have Aoi and Minmi in my corner,</b>

14:27.520 --> 14:30.640
<b>and Tomozaki and Mizusawa are helping out, too.</b>

14:31.520 --> 14:33.310
<b>Thank goodness.</b>

14:33.310 --> 14:35.390
<b>I appreciate your concern, though!</b>

14:35.750 --> 14:40.400
<b>You have so many friends on 
whom you can rely. I'm jealous.</b>

14:40.660 --> 14:44.160
<b>Yeah, everyone but Tomozaki is a real rock.</b>

14:44.160 --> 14:44.820
<b>Hey!</b>

14:46.070 --> 14:51.000
<b>If all these people will flock to you 
even in such a terrible situation,</b>

14:51.000 --> 14:54.280
<b>it must mean they really care about you.</b>

14:54.280 --> 14:56.540
<b>N-Now you're just making me blush!</b>

14:57.800 --> 15:00.480
<b>You're a wonderful person, 
Hanabi. And cute, too.</b>

15:00.480 --> 15:03.540
<b>No! I'm just short, that's all!</b>

15:03.540 --> 15:04.570
<b>Short?</b>

15:05.550 --> 15:07.920
<b>No, wait! Forget I said anything!</b>

15:09.200 --> 15:11.090
<b>Good thing we did this dry run.</b>

15:11.090 --> 15:12.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:12.080 --> 15:13.430
<b>Hey, Tama!</b>

15:13.650 --> 15:16.590
<b>Don't go running so far away 
just because you're embarrassed.</b>

15:16.590 --> 15:21.250
<b>I'm short, that's all! I only
 <i>look</i> like I'm far away!</b>

15:21.250 --> 15:22.310
<b>Oh, really?</b>

15:22.310 --> 15:24.100
<b>Yes, really! It's an optical illusion!</b>

15:25.130 --> 15:27.070
<b>You're cute, all right.</b>

15:27.070 --> 15:29.020
<b>Look, it's like I said...</b>

15:32.070 --> 15:34.070
<b>Old AV Room</b>

15:34.640 --> 15:36.580
<b><i>I think that's enough practice for today.</i></b>

15:37.120 --> 15:38.450
<b>How was it, Kikuchi?</b>

15:38.650 --> 15:41.460
<b>It was very easy to talk with Hanabi.</b>

15:41.730 --> 15:43.520
<b>I'd call that a success!</b>

15:43.520 --> 15:49.730
<b>Now we have to see if Tama can 
start to care about her classmates.</b>

15:49.730 --> 15:50.920
<b>Right.</b>

15:54.210 --> 15:57.430
<b>If you're anything like first-semester me,</b>

15:57.710 --> 16:00.770
<b>I'm betting your thinking goes like this:</b>

16:00.770 --> 16:04.690
<b>Whatever happens in class, it's a 
world that has nothing to do with me.</b>

16:05.320 --> 16:07.820
<b>I can't be a part of any of that.</b>

16:08.080 --> 16:09.300
<b>That's...</b>

16:11.200 --> 16:12.200
<b>Yeah, maybe.</b>

16:12.480 --> 16:14.950
<b>Back when I felt that way,</b>

16:15.560 --> 16:17.030
<b>I could be surrounded by fun,</b>

16:17.700 --> 16:21.410
<b>yet that reality seemed less 
relevant to me than fiction.</b>

16:21.410 --> 16:24.310
<b>Everything was just... gray.</b>

16:24.860 --> 16:28.170
<b>But once I took that blind leap,</b>

16:28.170 --> 16:32.270
<b>color came into that gray 
world, slowly but surely.</b>

16:32.270 --> 16:35.430
<b>I began to be able to take more of 
an interest in the people around me.</b>

16:35.840 --> 16:40.430
<b>Tama, you probably think people 
don't like you very much.</b>

16:41.310 --> 16:44.190
<b>But truly bad people are rare.</b>

16:45.310 --> 16:48.060
<b>The way I see it, if I may...</b>

16:48.330 --> 16:54.070
<b>Konno, say, is a sore loser, and she 
hates when people look down on her.</b>

16:54.290 --> 16:59.580
<b>But to the people she decides are her 
friends, she can be compassionate as well.</b>

16:59.870 --> 17:04.300
<b>Kamimae and Akiyama must have 
very little confidence,</b>

17:04.300 --> 17:09.460
<b>and so they make confident friends 
to fill that void in themselves.</b>

17:09.750 --> 17:13.870
<b>Yet that's also a lovely 
way to take the initiative</b>

17:13.870 --> 17:15.790
<b>and change the situation around them.</b>

17:16.380 --> 17:21.980
<b>Izumi puts others before herself and tends 
to be on the losing side because of it.</b>

17:22.460 --> 17:28.270
<b>But that's kindness, too, that has her 
feeling others' pain as if it were her own.</b>

17:29.000 --> 17:34.080
<b>Each character in the story 
that is our classroom</b>

17:34.080 --> 17:38.410
<b>has their own worries, 
their own growth, their own faults.</b>

17:39.000 --> 17:42.910
<b>There's not a person alive who 
is truly thinking nothing at all.</b>

17:43.440 --> 17:48.670
<b>I wonder if that realization might 
spark your interest a little.</b>

17:50.720 --> 17:51.670
<b>Uh-huh.</b>

17:52.710 --> 17:53.890
<b>I've been thinking.</b>

17:55.030 --> 17:58.460
<b>You—and Kikuchi, too, who knows—</b>

17:59.020 --> 18:02.810
<b>for as slow as your progress 
may be, it's careful as hell.</b>

18:04.270 --> 18:06.090
<b>The complete opposite of me.</b>

18:08.000 --> 18:08.940
<b>Tama!</b>

18:09.200 --> 18:11.170
<b>Here I am!</b>

18:11.170 --> 18:11.690
<b>Wait...</b>

18:12.060 --> 18:14.690
<b>Now you've got Kikuchi with you?</b>

18:15.700 --> 18:17.450
<b>H-Hello...</b>

18:18.180 --> 18:20.370
<b>What kind of match-up is this?</b>

18:20.610 --> 18:24.960
<b>Kikuchi's temporarily assisting 
Team Tomozaki today.</b>

18:25.420 --> 18:28.000
<b>She was pals with Fumiya and 
decided to lend us a hand.</b>

18:28.310 --> 18:30.290
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

18:30.290 --> 18:32.050
<b>I didn't see <i>that</i> coming.</b>

18:39.940 --> 18:41.090
<b>You're cute.</b>

18:42.970 --> 18:46.980
<b>How could I have overlooked 
such an adorable girl?!</b>

18:46.980 --> 18:49.480
<b>Welcome... to Nanami World!</b>

18:49.480 --> 18:52.480
<b>N-Nanami... World?</b>

18:52.480 --> 18:55.230
<b>C'mon, Mimimi, dial it 
down a notch, would you?</b>

18:55.670 --> 18:57.740
<b>She's not used to your 
brand of... enthusiasm.</b>

18:58.500 --> 19:02.880
<b>You're the worst! How could you 
take Kikuchi's side and not mine?</b>

19:02.880 --> 19:05.420
<b>That's not the issue here!</b>

19:05.830 --> 19:09.830
<b>Yikes! I forgot to hand 
in my journal entries!</b>

19:10.210 --> 19:12.130
<b>Will you come with me, Mimimi?</b>

19:12.380 --> 19:14.090
<b>Huh? Me?</b>

19:19.760 --> 19:21.760
<b>Okay, I'll tag along!</b>

19:21.760 --> 19:22.890
<b>You too, Tama!</b>

19:22.890 --> 19:25.470
<b>Me too? Why?</b>

19:25.470 --> 19:27.470
<b>Just... c'mon!</b>

19:27.750 --> 19:30.580
<b>I forgot something, too, back 
in the classroom. Be right back.</b>

19:32.260 --> 19:33.340
<b>Sure...</b>

19:39.740 --> 19:42.740
<b>Today
Takahiro: We're heading home! Good luck!
Read 
Hey!</b>

19:40.960 --> 19:42.740
<b><i>I've been hornswoggled.</i></b>

19:43.420 --> 19:46.220
<b>This is the first time 
we've gone home together.</b>

19:47.010 --> 19:48.950
<b>I-I guess so.</b>

19:49.340 --> 19:53.090
<b>Um... how did today go for you?</b>

19:53.090 --> 19:53.750
<b>Well...</b>

19:54.530 --> 19:59.410
<b>I was kind of nervous being around so 
many people I hadn't talked to that much before.</b>

19:59.410 --> 20:04.950
<b>But it was nice to see you chatting 
with everyone for a change.</b>

20:04.950 --> 20:06.400
<b>Was it?</b>

20:06.940 --> 20:09.600
<b>I thought it was nice having a front-row seat</b>

20:09.600 --> 20:12.510
<b>to see you enjoying yourself 
with everyone for a change.</b>

20:13.140 --> 20:15.410
<b>Nice... and a lot of fun.</b>

20:15.410 --> 20:16.650
<b>R-Really?</b>

20:17.260 --> 20:23.400
<b>You're always showing me things 
I've never seen before.</b>

20:29.760 --> 20:31.000
<b><i>Finally, the next day,</i></b>

20:31.000 --> 20:35.420
<b><i>Tama put her lessons to 
work in the classroom.</i></b>

20:35.420 --> 20:39.300
<b>Don't stand so far away, Tama—c'mere!</b>

20:39.300 --> 20:42.670
<b>I'm <i>not</i> far away! It just <i>looks</i> 
that way because I'm small!</b>

20:42.670 --> 20:43.620
<b>It's called perspective!</b>

20:43.620 --> 20:47.050
<b>Hey, was this desk always so big?</b>

20:47.050 --> 20:49.850
<b>It only <i>looks</i> big because I'm so small!</b>

20:49.850 --> 20:52.060
<b><i>Hinami helped out here, too.</i></b>

20:52.060 --> 20:53.600
<b>You're funny, Tama!</b>

20:52.060 --> 20:58.060
<b><i>She gathered the girls who were her 
and Mimimi's friends around Tama.</i></b>

20:58.300 --> 21:00.470
<b>Hey, this group should hang out sometime!</b>

21:00.470 --> 21:03.530
<b>Sure—how about <i>tama</i>-rrow?</b>

21:03.530 --> 21:04.930
<b>Yes!</b>

21:04.080 --> 21:06.780
<b>Hey, don't shoehorn me into this!</b>

21:10.900 --> 21:12.520
<b>Cheers!</b>

21:14.030 --> 21:15.790
<b>Thanks, gang!</b>

21:16.040 --> 21:18.580
<b>Great job, Tama!</b>

21:19.310 --> 21:24.090
<b>Keep it like this, and Konno 
should knock off the harassment, too.</b>

21:24.380 --> 21:25.900
<b>You think so?</b>

21:25.900 --> 21:30.080
<b>Once the class is on your side, people will
 start getting irritated with Erika</b>

21:30.080 --> 21:32.310
<b>if the mood in the classroom goes sour.</b>

21:32.850 --> 21:35.100
<b>And she's super sensitive to that stuff,</b>

21:35.100 --> 21:37.100
<b>so she'll give it a rest.</b>

21:37.900 --> 21:39.110
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

21:39.440 --> 21:42.660
<b>Mimimi said she'll join us 
once her club meeting's over.</b>

21:42.660 --> 21:46.490
<b>Aoi's still got student council work,
 so she's a no-show.</b>

21:46.800 --> 21:48.120
<b>What about Fuka?</b>

21:48.120 --> 21:51.020
<b>Oh, uh, apparently she has work today.</b>

21:51.020 --> 21:54.000
<b>Hmm? What's this about Kikuchi?</b>

21:54.000 --> 21:56.870
<b>Ask Fumiya. They're <i>friends</i>.</b>

21:57.500 --> 22:00.670
<b>Oh? Is Army Boy finally growing up?</b>

22:00.670 --> 22:02.660
<b><i>It's not like that!</i></b>

22:02.660 --> 22:04.570
<b>You're blushing, Tomozaki.</b>

22:07.680 --> 22:09.460
<b>Hello, Erika?</b>
